2 CONT #	[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lorenzo_de%27_Medici#Later_years,_death,_and_legacy Later years, death, and legacy]
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----------
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Lorenzo I de Medic'''i M, #4790, b. 1 January 1449, d. 8 April 1492 Last Edited=30 Sep 2005 Lorenzo I de Medici was born on 1 January 1449. He was the son of Piero I de Medici. (1) He married Clara Orsini, daughter of James Ors
2 CONC ini, on 20 December 1469.  He died on 8 April 1492 at age 43. Lorenzo I de Medici also went by the nick-name of Lorenzo 'the Magnificent'. (2) He held the office of Governor of Florence in 1469. (2) Children of Lorenzo I de Medici
2 CONC  and Clara Orsini -1. Giuliano de Nemours+ (2) d. 1516 -2. Piero II de Medici+ (2) b. 15 Feb 1471, d. 28 Dec 1503
2 CONT
2 CONT Forrás / Source: http://thepeerage.com/p479.htm#i4790
