2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=18 Sep 2002
2 CONT
2 CONT      Clara Orsini was the daughter of James Orsini. She married Lorenzo I de Medici, son of Piero I de Medici, on 20 December 1469. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died circa 1488.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Clara Orsini and Lorenzo I de Medici
2 CONT
2 CONT -1. Giuliano de Nemours+1 d. 1516
2 CONT
2 CONT -2. Piero II de Medici+ b. 15 Feb 1471, d. 28 Dec 1503
