2 CONT ===Comments
2 CONT
2 CONT From https://www.geni.com/people/Antonio-Moncada-di-Patern%C3%B2/6000000030609899172
2 CONT
2 CONT The painting of Filippino Lippi depicting Tanai and Giovanna Capponi was done ca. 1494, when both Tanai and Giovanna were still alive. Clearly Giovanna looks old, even older than Tanai. If she were to be moved one generation down,
2 CONC  she would look much younger.
2 CONT
2 CONT Treccani says that Tanai was married to Giovanna at least since 1446. Assuming she was born around 1425, she couldn't be the daughter of Gino and Maddalena Mannelli.
2 CONT
2 CONT E. Gamurrini, Istoria Genealogica delle Famiglie Nobili, Toscane et Umbre, Vol. V (1685), page 12 states that Tanai married "Anna di Neri di Gino Capponi" from whom he had nine sons and five daughters. Gamurrini states that he stu
2 CONC died the Nerli family in depth.
2 CONT
2 CONT I think Treccani erroneously wrote "di Gino di Neri" instead of "di Neri di Gino".
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT https://sepoltuario.iath.virginia.edu/individuals/5005
2 CONT
2 CONT daughter of Capponi, Neri di Gino di Neri di Recco di Mico	
2 CONT wife of Nerli, Jacopo di Francesco di Filippo di Loso di Lapo (detto Tanai)	
2 CONT mother of Nerli, Benedetto (messer) di Tanai di Francesco di Filippo di Loso	
2 CONT
