1 NOTE {geni:about_me} - https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rinaldo_Orsini_(arcivescovo%29
2 CONT
2 CONT Rinaldo Orsini (... - ...) was an Italian Catholic archbishop of the powerful Roman family , archbishop of Florence from 1474 to 1508 , after Pietro Riario .
2 CONT
2 CONT Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT He had the archbishopric of Florence thanks to the interest of the Medici , being related to the Orsini with the marriage of Lorenzo the Magnificent and Clarice Orsini ( 1469 ).
2 CONT
2 CONT It granted the first printed Constitutions of the Florentine Chapter in 1483 , confirmed in 1504 .
2 CONT
2 CONT Although belonging to the Orsini had facilitated him in his ecclesiastical career initially, at a later time due to the continuous political upheavals he suffered numerous difficulties. For example, if Pope Sixtus IV confirmed the
2 CONC  privileges of the Florentine archbishop, Alexander VI Borgia imprisoned him along with his brother, Cardinal Giovanni Battista Orsini , when the pontiff entered into a fight against Orsino Orsini, husband of his lover Giulia Farn
2 CONC ese .
2 CONT
2 CONT With Giulio II Rinaldo was also disappointed by the refusal to grant him the cardinal's purple. Embittered at having been forgotten, he renounced the Florence branch at the consistory of 5 July 1508 .
