2 CONT '''Nobility. Born the younger of the two daughters''' of Jean de Auvergne and Jeanne de Bourbon-Vendome. '''After her father's death, she became Countess of Auvergne. She was married to Lorenzo II de Medici in 1518. She died in th
2 CONC e following year, two weeks after giving birth to their only child.
