2 CONT
2 CONT http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Catherine_de%27_Medici
2 CONT
2 CONT http://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Catalina_de_M%C3%A9dici
2 CONT
2 CONT http://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Caterina_de%27_Medici
2 CONT
2 CONT http://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Catherine_de_M%C3%A9dicis
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.nndb.com/people/100/000091824/
