2 CONC ude de Valois, Duchesse de Bretagne, '''on 28 October 1533.1 She died on 5 January 1589 at age 69.
2 CONT *'''     She gained the title of Comtesse de Lauraguais.1 She gained the title of Comtesse d'Auvergne.1
