1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Salvestro De' Medici , known as Chiarissimo , ( fl. 14th century ) was an Italian politician .
2 CONT
2 CONT Salvestro was the son of Averardo di Averardo de' Medici , who was called Chiarissimo and was the father of Averardo called Bicci who in turn gave birth to Giovanni di Bicci . It is known that he was ambassador to Venice in 1336 ,
2 CONC  but his dates of birth and death are unknown.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Lisa Donati and they had three children [ 1 ] :
2 CONT # Giovenco;
2 CONT # Averardo (* 1320 † 1363 ), married Giovanna di Lotto Cavallini and then Giacoma di Francesco Spini;
2 CONT # Talento, he married Giovanna Buoninsegni.
2 CONT
2 CONT
