1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pierre_de_Gondi '''Pierre de Gondi, cardinal de Retz '''] Pierre de Gondi, cardinal de Retz (1533–1616) was a French bishop and cardinal of the Gondi family.
2 CONT ====Life====
2 CONT
2 CONT Born in Lyon, he was a brother of Albert de Gondi (two of whose sons, Henri and Jean-François, succeeded Pierre as bishop of Paris) and a protégé of Catherine de Médicis. In turn, he became bishop of Langres (1565), bishop of Pari
2 CONC s (1570), chancellor and grand almoner to Elisabeth of Austria, wife of Charles IX of France.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was created cardinal in 1587.
2 CONT
2 CONT Godni undertook several missions to Rome under Henry III of France and Henry IV of France and attended the 1592 papal conclave.
