2 CONC e the daughter of Bernardo Marabottini. The Marabottini are a branch of the Tornaquinci family (Spreti, ''Enciclopedia'', Vol. IV, p. 342).
2 CONT * https://sepoltuario.iath.virginia.edu/individuals/9489 
