2 CONT Generation No. 1
2 CONT
2 CONT JACOPO1 DI GENOVA was born Abt. 1430 in Italy, and died Unknown.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married LENORA DI MEDICI Abt. 1460 in Florence, Italy, daughter of LORENZO DE MEDICI [??] and /.  She was born Abt. 1435 in Florence, Italy, and died Unknown. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of JACOPO DI GENOVA and LENORA DI MEDICI is: 
2 CONT *2.	i.	 	RICARDO2 DI GENOVA, b. Abt. 1465, Italy; d. Unknown. married DONA CID-RUY-DIAZ
