2 CONT Francesco I de Medici, Granduca di Toscana1
2 CONT
2 CONT M, #112038, b. 25 March 1541, d. 19 October 1587
2 CONT
2 CONT Francesco I de Medici, Granduca di Toscana was born on 25 March 1541. He was the son of Cosimo I de Medici, Granduca di Toscana and Eleanora de Toledo. He married, firstly, Joanna Erzherzogin von Österreich, daughter of Ferdinand 
2 CONC I von Habsburg, Holy Roman Emperor and Anna Jagellon, on 18 December 1565 at Florence, Italy.3,2 He died on 19 October 1587 at age 46, murdered.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Francesco I de Medici, Granduca di Toscana succeeded to the title of Granduca di Toscana in 1574.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Francesco I de Medici, Granduca di Toscana and Joanna Erzherzogin von Österreich
2 CONT
2 CONT Eleonora de Medici+ b. 28 Feb 1567, d. 19 Sep 1611 (4) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Marie de Medici+ b. 26 Apr 1573, d. 3 Jul 1642 (5) 
