1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''John III of Auvergne (1467 – 28 March 1501), Count of Auvergne, Count of Boulogne, Count de Lauraguais, was the son''' of Bertrand VI, Count of Auvergne and Louise de La Trémoille (1432 – 10 April 1474), Dame de
2 CONC  Boussac, the daughter of Georges de la Trémoille. '''He was the last in the male line of Counts of Auvergne from the La Tour d'Auvergne family.'''
2 CONT Family and children
2 CONT '''John married Jeanne de Bourbon-Vendôme''', daughter of Jean VIII, Count of Vendôme,[1] and Isabelle, Dame de la Roche-sur-Yon, '''on 11 January 1495. They had:'''
2 CONT 1. Anne,[2] married John Stewart, 2nd Duke of Albany.
2 CONT 2. Madeleine, married Lorenzo II, Duke of Urbino.[1]
2 CONT https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_IV,_Count_of_Auvergne
