1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Jeanne de Bourbon (1465 – 22 January 1511) was a daughter''' of John II, Count of Vendôme and Isabelle de Beauvau.
2 CONT Family and lineage
2 CONT '''She was a daughter''' of John II, Count of Vendôme[1] and Isabelle de Beauvau.[2] '''Her maternal grandparents''' were Louis de Beauvau, Seneschal of Anjou and Marguerite de Chambley.[clarification needed]
2 CONT '''Her paternal grandparents''' were Louis, Count of Vendôme and Jeanne of Laval. Louis had served as both Grand Chamberman of France and Grand Master of France. He was a prominent member of the Armagnac party.
2 CONT Marriages and issues
2 CONT '''She married first John II, Duke of Bourbon in 1487. The groom was about sixty-one years old and the bride only twenty-two. John had survived two previous wives and his only son. He was in a need of an heir; however, they had on
2 CONC ly one son''':
2 CONT *Louis, Count of Clermont (1488). He was the desired heir but did not long survive his birth.
2 CONT '''John II died the same year as his second and last known son'''.
2 CONT '''Jeanne remained a widow for seven years. On 11 January 1495, Jeanne married her second husband John III, Count of Auvergne.[1] They had''':
2 CONT 1. Anne,[3] married John Stewart, 2nd Duke of Albany.
2 CONT 2. Madeleine, married Lorenzo II, Duke of Urbino.[1] She was the mother of Catherine de' Medici.[1]
2 CONT '''John III''' died on 28 March 1501.
2 CONT '''On March 27, 1503 she married her third and final husband, François de La Pause, baron de la Garde. They had no children'''.
2 CONT https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jeanne_of_Bourbon,_Duchess_of_Bourbon
2 CONT '''Jeanne de Bourbon'''
2 CONT '''Duchess of Bourbon'''
2 CONT '''Countess of Auvergne'''
2 CONT '''Baroness de la Garde'''
2 CONT '''Born	1465'''
2 CONT '''Died	January 22, 1511 (aged 45–46)'''
2 CONT Noble family	House of Bourbon
2 CONT '''Spouse(s)'''	
2 CONT '''John II, Duke of Bourbon'''
2 CONT '''John III, Count of Auvergne'''
2 CONT '''Issue'''
2 CONT Louis, Count of Clermont
2 CONT Anne, Countess of Auvergne
2 CONT Madeleine de La Tour d'Auvergne
2 CONT '''Father'''	John II, Count of Vendôme
2 CONT '''Mother'''	Isabelle de Beauvau
2 CONT ___
2 CONT '''Jeanne de Bourbon'''1 
2 CONT F, #108298, '''b. 1465, d. 22 January 1511'''
2 CONT Last Edited=30 Jun 2020
2 CONT '''    Jeanne de Bourbon was born in 1465. She was the daughter''' of Jean II de Bourbon, Comte de Vendôme and Isabel de Beauveau.1 '''She married, firstly, Jean II de Bourbon, Duc de Bourbon''', son of Charles I de Bourbon, Duc d
2 CONC e Bourbon and Agnes de Bourgogne, '''in 1487.2 She married, secondly, Jean III de la Tour, Comte d'Auvergne''', son of Bernard VI de la Tour, Comte d'Auvergne and Louise de la Trémoille, '''on 11 January 1495.2 She married Françoi
2 CONC s de La Pause, Baron de la Garde on 27 March 1503.2 She died on 22 January 1511'''.
2 CONT '''Child of Jeanne de Bourbon and Jean II de Bourbon, Duc de Bourbon'''
2 CONT 1. Louis de Bourbon, Comte de Clermont2 b. 1488, d. 1488
2 CONT '''Children of Jeanne de Bourbon and Jean III de la Tour, Comte d'Auvergne'''
2 CONT 1. Madeleine de la Tour+3 d. 23 Apr 1519
2 CONT 2. Anne de la Tour, Comtesse d'Auvergne1 b. a 1495, d. Jun 1524
