2 CONT '''Jeanne 'the Beautiful' de Bourbon'''1,2,3
2 CONT Last Edited	27 May 2013
2 CONT F, #49927, '''b. circa 1465, d. 22 January 1512'''
2 CONT '''Father'''	Jean II de Bourbon, Comte de Vendome2,3 b. 1425, d. 6 Jan 1478
2 CONT '''Mother'''	Isabel Beauvieu1 b. c 1436, d. 1474
2 CONT '''     Jeanne 'the Beautiful' de Bourbon was born circa 1465.1 She married Jean II, 6th Duke de Bourbon, 3rd Duke d'Auvergne''', son of Charles, Duke of Bourbon, Duke d'Auvergne, Grand Marshal of France, Governor of Languedoc, Co
2 CONC unt of Clermont and Agnes of Burgundy, '''circa June 1487.4 A contract for the marriage of Jeanne 'the Beautiful' de Bourbon and Jean I, Sire de la Tour, Comte d'Auvergne, Lauraguais, & Boulogne was signed on 2 January 1495.5,6,2,
2 CONC 3 Jeanne 'the Beautiful' de Bourbon died on 22 January 1512; Buried at Eglise de Cordeliers, Vic le Comte, Auvergne'''.1
