2 CONT
2 CONT      Beatriz de Aviz, Infanta de Portugal was born in 1504. (1) She was the daughter of Manuel I de Aviz, Rei de Portugal and Maria de Castilla y Aragón, Infanta de Castilla. (1) She married Carlo II, Duca di Savoia, son of Filipp
2 CONC o II di Bresse, Duca di Savoia, in 1521. (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in 1538. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT      Beatriz de Aviz, Infanta de Portugal gained the title of Infanta de Portugal. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Beatriz de Aviz, Infanta de Portugal and Carlo II, Duca di Savoia
2 CONT
2 CONT -1. Emanuele Filiberto, Duca di Savoia+2 b. 8 Jul 1528, d. 30 Aug 1580
