2 CONT The Infanta Beatriz (Portuguese pronunciation: [biɐˈtɾiʃ]); English: Beatrice or Beatrix) (December 31, 1504 – January 8, 1538) was a Portuguese infanta (princess) during the 16th century and a member of the House of Aviz dynasty.
