2 CONT She was the eldest daughter of Ercole II d'Este , Duke of Ferrara (son of Lucrezia Borgia ), and Princess Renée of France (daughter of King Louis XII and Anne of Brittany ). Duchess of Aumale , then of Guise , by his first marriag
