1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Henri_de_Gondi_(1572-1622)
2 CONT
2 CONT Henri de Gondi (1572 – 13 August 1622) was a French bishop and cardinal of the Gondi family. He was the son of Albert de Gondi, duc de Retz and Claude Catherine de Clermont-Tonnerre. He succeeded his uncle Pierre de Gondi as bisho
2 CONC p of Paris in 1598 and was succeeded on his death by his younger brother Jean-François de Gondi. He was made a cardinal in 1618.
