1 OCCU ambassadeur van de koning van Engeland in de Lage Landen
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Ambassador to the Court of St. James. (Henry VIII of England).
2 CONT
2 CONT From "The Spinelli of Florence: Fortunes of a Renaissance Merchant Family" by Philip Jacks and William Caferro. (https://books.google.com/books?id=xr3cD7jJdLUC):
2 CONT
2 CONT "… Guasparre's eldest son, Tommaso, whose distinguished career as papal ambassador to the court of Henry VIII in England earned him knighthood in the Order of the Golden Spur."
2 CONT
2 CONT Two children?  Constantia and Petrus?
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.genealogieonline.nl/stamboom-boris-schubert-moonlight/R10092.php
2 CONT
2 CONT http://sennewini.blogspot.nl/2014/01/spinelli-revisited-met-resultaat.html
2 CONT
2 CONT Archive record for his correspondence in service to Henry VIII: http://discovery.nationalarchives.gov.uk/details/rd/N13943812
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Ambassador to the Court of St. James. (Henry VIII of England).
2 CONT
2 CONT From "The Spinelli of Florence: Fortunes of a Renaissance Merchant Family" by Philip Jacks and William Caferro. (https://books.google.com/books?id=xr3cD7jJdLUC):
2 CONT
2 CONT "… Guasparre's eldest son, Tommaso, whose distinguished career as papal ambassador to the court of Henry VIII in England earned him knighthood in the Order of the Golden Spur."
2 CONT
2 CONT Two children? Constantia and Petrus?
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.genealogieonline.nl/stamboom-boris-schubert-moonlight/R10092.php
2 CONT
2 CONT http://sennewini.blogspot.nl/2014/01/spinelli-revisited-met-resultaat.html
2 CONT
2 CONT Archive record for his correspondence in service to Henry VIII: http://discovery.nationalarchives.gov.uk/details/rd/N13943812
2 CONT
2 CONT -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Tommaso di Guasparre Spinelli''', o.a. ambassadeur van de Engelse koning Henry VIII in de Lage Landen, geboren [te Florence] in 1472, overleden in na 1522. Hij is verm. gehuwd (2) ca. 1524 met Daniela di Matteo Federighi. Hij i
2 CONC s gehuwd (1) met Marietta d’Alamanno Alamanneschi.
2 CONT
2 CONT Hij had een buitenechtelijke relatie [of was gehuwd] ca. 1515 met Katharina Douwens Petersdr., uit Antwerpen, overleden na 11 april 1535. Haar naam blijkt uit Tommaso’s testament en de huwelijksvoorwaarden van haar dochter. Dat zi
2 CONC j een De Cordes zou zijn zoals van oudsher beweerd wordt.
2 CONT
2 CONT | 03.08.2021 | FA: Notarissen.[70] Yale: Spinelli Archive.[71] CBG: Dossier Coymans. Jacks en Caferro (2001)
2 CONT
