2 CONC  de Medici, Granduca di Toscana, son of Cosimo I de Medici, Granduca di Toscana and Eleanora de Toledo, on 18 December 1565 at Florence, Italy.3,1 She died on 10 April 1578 at age 31 at Florence, Italy.2,1
