2 CONT Alfonso III d'Este, Duca di Modena (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT M, #3124, b. 20 October 1591, d. 24 May 1644
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=30 Sep 2005
2 CONT
2 CONT      Alfonso III d'Este, Duca di Modena was born on 20 October 1591. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the son of Cesar d'Este, Duca di Modena and Virginia de Medici. (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Isabel di Savoia, daughter of Carlo Emanuele I, Duca di Savoia and Catalina Micaela von Habsburg, on 22 February 1608. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 24 May 1644 at age 52.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Alfonso III d'Este, Duca di Modena succeeded to the title of Duca di Modena in 1628. (1) He abdicated as Duke of Modena in 1629. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Alfonso III d'Este, Duca di Modena and Isabel di Savoia
2 CONT
2 CONT -1. Francesco I d'Este, Duca di Modena+1 b. 5 Sep 1610, d. 13 Oct 1658
