2 CONT '''Jean II de Bourbon, Comte de Vendôme'''1 
2 CONT M, #113704, '''b. between 1425 and 1446, d. 6 January 1477'''
2 CONT Last Edited=2 Jun 2013
2 CONT Consanguinity Index=0.02%
2 CONT '''     Jean II de Bourbon, Comte de Vendôme was born between 1425 and 1446. He was the son''' of Louis de Bourbon, Comte de Vendôme and Jeanne de Laval.1 '''He was baptised before 1464. He married Isabel de Beauveau''', daughter 
2 CONC of Louis de Beauveau, Seigneur de Champigny and Margaret de Chambley, '''on 9 November 1454. He died on 6 January 1477'''.1
2 CONT '''     He gained the title of Comte de Vendôme'''.1
2 CONT '''Children of Jean II de Bourbon, Comte de Vendôme and Isabel de Beauveau'''
2 CONT 1. Louis de Bourbon, Prince de Roche-sur-Yon+1 d. 1520
2 CONT 2. Jeanne de Bourbon+2 b. 1465, d. 22 Jan 1511
2 CONT 3. François de Bourbon, Duc de Vendôme+1 b. 1470, d. 1495
2 CONT 4. Charlotte de Bourbon-Vendôme+3 b. 1474, d. 14 Dec 1520
2 CONT Citations
