2 CONT *'''Diane de Poitiers, Duchess of Valentinois1,2
2 CONT *'''F, #81265, b. 3 September 1499, d. 22 April 1566 or 26 April 1566
2 CONT *Father	Sir Jean de Poitiers, Vicomte d'Estoile, Baron de Clerieu, Florac, & Serignan3 d. b 31 Dec 1539
2 CONT *Mother	Jeanne de Batarnay3 d. b 8 Jun 1516
2 CONT *'''     Diane de Poitiers, Duchess of Valentinois was born on 3 September 1499.3,2 A contract for the marriage of Diane de Poitiers, Duchess of Valentinois and Louis de Breze, Comte de Maulevrier, Seigneur de la Marche was signed
2 CONC  on 29 March 1514.1,3,2 Diane de Poitiers, Duchess of Valentinois died on 22 April 1566 or 26 April 1566 at Chateau d'Anet; Buried at Chateau d'Anet.3,2
2 CONT *'''Family     Louis de Breze, Comte de Maulevrier, Seigneur de la Marche''' b. 1460, d. 23 Jul 1531
2 CONT *'''Children	
2 CONT **Louise de Breze+1 d. Jan 1577
2 CONT **Françoise de Breze+ d. 14 Oct 1577
