2 CONT *'''Diane de Poitiers, Duchesse de Valentinois1
2 CONT *'''F, #323893, b. circa 1500, d. 26 April 1566
2 CONT *Last Edited=27 May 2012
2 CONT *'''     Diane de Poitiers, Duchesse de Valentinois was born circa 1500.1 She was the daughter''' of Jean de Poitiers, Vicomte d'Estoile and Jean de Batarnay.1 '''She married Louis de Brézé, Comte de Maulevrier''', son of Jacques 
2 CONC de Brézé, Comte de Maulevrier and Charlotte de Valois, '''on 16 April 1515 at Hotel de Bourbon, Paris, France.1 She died on 26 April 1566 at Chateau d'Anet, Eure et Loir, France.1
2 CONT *'''     She gained the title of Comtesse de Saint Vallier. She gained the title of Duchesse de Valentinois. She and Henri II, Roi de France were associated.2 From 16 April 1515, her married name became de Brézé.1
2 CONT *'''Children of Diane de Poitiers, Duchesse de Valentinois and Louis de Brézé, Comte de Maulevrier
2 CONT **Françoise de Brézé1 b. 1515, d. 14 Oct 1577
2 CONT **Louise de Brézé+1 b. 1518, d. Jan 1577
2 CONT *Citations
