2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret of France, Duchess of Berry
2 CONT
2 CONT Marguerite of France (born Saint-Germain-en-Laye on the 5 June 1523 - died Turin, 15 September 1574) was the daughter of King Francis I of France and Claude, Duchess of Brittany.
2 CONT
2 CONT Contents [hide]
2 CONT
