2 CONC t the king making peace, agreed to make the Piedmont for her to marry the Duke of Savoy. Although she had desired all her life to marry, she had never wanted to marry a sovereign, and had refused for this reason the King of Navarr
2 CONC e, when he was Duke of Vendôme, and had always liked Mr. Savoy, it had retained the inclination for him since she saw him in Nice in the interview of King Francis I of the Pope Paul the third."
