2 TITL Mary I, Queen of Scots 1542-1587 Wife of François II, roi de France; Henry Stewart, Lord Darnley and Sir James Hepburn, 1st & Last Duke of Orkney is your fourth cousin 13 times removed.
2 NOTE Mary I, Queen of Scots is your fourth cousin 13 times removed.  
3 CONT You 
3 CONT    →  Marijane T Lehr 
3 CONT your mother →  Erwin Cecil Trotter 
3 CONT her father →  Alice Catherine (Corwin) Trotter 
3 CONT his mother →  Benjamin Franklin Corwin 
3 CONT her father → John Corwin 
3 CONT his father →  Lydia Corwin 
3 CONT his mother →  Israel Swayze 
3 CONT her father →  Israel Swayze 
3 CONT his father →  Judge Samuel Swayze 
3 CONT his father →  Joseph Swasey 
3 CONT his father → Katherine Swasey 
3 CONT his mother →  Dorothy King 
3 CONT her mother →  John Haynes, Sr. 
3 CONT her father →  Nicholas Haines 
3 CONT his father →  Richard Haines 
3 CONT his father →  Lady Elspeth Stewart 
3 CONT his mother →  John Stewart, 1st Earl of Atholl 
3 CONT her father →  Joan Beaufort, Queen consort of Scots 
3 CONT his mother →  James II of Scotland 
