2 CONT      Catalina Micaela von Habsburg was born on 10 October 1567 at Segovia, Spain.1 She was the daughter of Felipe II von Habsburg, Rey de España and Elizabeth de Valois, Princesse de France.1 She married Carlo Emanuele I, Duca di 
2 CONC Savoia, son of Emanuele Filiberto, Duca di Savoia and Marguerite de Valois, Duchesse de Berri, on 11 March 1585 at Saragosa, Spain. She died on 6 November 1597 at age 30 at Turin, Italy.1 Children of Catalina Micaela von Habsburg 
