2 CONT Elisabeth of Austria (5 July 1554 – 22 January 1592) was born an Archduchess of Austria, and later became Queen of France. She was the daughter of Holy Roman Emperor Maximilian II and Maria of Spain. She was married to Charles IX 
2 CONC of France for three and a half years, until his death.
2 CONT
