2 CONT '''Marguerite d' Orleans, Duchess d'Alencon & Berry'''1
2 CONT Last Edited	20 Mar 2002
2 CONT F, #81443, '''b. 11 April 1492, d. 21 December 1549'''
2 CONT '''Father'''	Charles d' Orleans, Comte d'Angouleme & Perigord2 b. 1459, d. 1 Jan 1496
2 CONT '''Mother'''	Louise de Savoy2 b. 11 Sep 1476, d. 22 Sep 1531
2 CONT '''     Marguerite d' Orleans, Duchess d'Alencon & Berry was born on 11 April 1492 at Angouleme, France.1 She married Henri II d' Albret, King of Navarre, Comte de Foix & Bigorre''', son of Jean d' Albret, King of Navarre and Kath
2 CONC arina de Foix, Queen of Navarre, Countess de Foix & Bigorre, '''on 24 January 1527 at St. Germaine en Laye.1 Marguerite d' Orleans, Duchess d'Alencon & Berry died on 21 December 1549 at Chateau d'Odos at age 57; Buried at Pau.'''1
2 CONT '''Family'''
2 CONT '''Henri II d' Albret, King of Navarre, Comte de Foix & Bigorre''' b. 24 Apr 1503, d. 29 May 1555
2 CONT '''Child'''	
2 CONT *Jeanne III d' Albret Queen of Navarre, Princess of Bearn+1 b. 7 Jan 1528, d. 9 Jun 1572
