2 CONT
2 CONT Charlotte de Bourbon (1388–1422)
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Jump to: navigation, search
2 CONT
2 CONT Charlotte
2 CONT
2 CONT Janus (left) and Charlotte (right)
2 CONT
2 CONT Queen consort of Cyprus; Titular Queen consort of Armenia and Jerusalem
2 CONT
2 CONT Tenure 	25 August 1411 – 15 January 1422
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse 	King Janus of Cyprus
2 CONT
2 CONT Issue
2 CONT
2 CONT Jacques de Lusignan
2 CONT
2 CONT John II of Cyprus
2 CONT
2 CONT Unnamed twins
2 CONT
2 CONT Anne de Lusignan
2 CONT
2 CONT Marie de Lusignan
2 CONT
2 CONT House 	House of Bourbon
2 CONT
2 CONT Father 	John I, Count of La Marche
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother 	Catherine of Vendôme
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 	1388
2 CONT
2 CONT France
2 CONT
