2 CONT *'''Louis de Luxembourg, Comte de St. Pol
2 CONT *'''M, #4780, b. circa 1418, d. 9 December 1475
2 CONT *Last Edited=26 May 2013
2 CONT *Consanguinity Index=0.0%
2 CONT *'''    Louis de Luxembourg, Comte de St. Pol was born circa 1418. He was the son''' of Pierre I de Luxembourg, Comte de St. Pol, Brienne et Conservan and Margherita del Balzo.1 '''He married Jeanne de Bar-Mousson, Comtesse de Mar
2 CONC ie et de Soissons''', daughter of Robert de Bar, Comte de Bar, '''on 16 July 1435. He married Maria di Savoia''', daughter of Ludovico I Duca di Savoia and Anne de Lusignan, Princess of Cyprus, '''in 1466.1 He died on 9 December 1
2 CONC 475 at Paris, France.2
2 CONT *'''     He gained the title of Comte de St. Pol. He held the office of Constable of France.1
2 CONT *'''Children of Louis de Luxembourg, Comte de St. Pol and Jeanne de Bar-Mousson, Comtesse de Marie et de Soissons
2 CONT **Pierre II de Luxembourg, Comte de St. Pol+ d. 25 Oct 1482
2 CONT **Antoine de Luxembourg, Comte de Brienne et de Ligny et de Roussy+2 b. 1445, d. 1519
2 CONT *Citations
