1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Rainuzzio I Farnese, Duca di Parma 
2 CONT
2 CONT M, #3129, b. 28 March 1569, d. 5 March 1622
2 CONT
2 CONT Rainuzzio I Farnese, Duca di Parma was born on 28 March 1569. He was the son of Alessandro Farnese, Duca di Parma and Maria de Aviz. He married Margherita Aldobrandini, daughter of John Francis Aldobrandini and Olimpia Aldobrandin
2 CONC i, on 7 May 1600. He died on 5 March 1622 at age 52.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Rainuzzio I Farnese, Duca di Parma gained the title of Duca di Piacenza in 1592. He succeeded to the title of Duca di Parma in 1592.2
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Rainuzzio I Farnese, Duca di Parma and Margherita Aldobrandini
