2 CONT
2 CONT Isabella of Portugal (24 October 1503 – 1 May 1539) was a Spanish queen consort and Holy Roman Empress, and a regent of Spain. She was the daughter of Manuel I of Portugal and Maria of Aragon. By her marriage to Charles V, Holy Ro
2 CONC man Emperor, Isabella was also Holy Roman Empress and Queen consort of Aragon and Castile. She served as the regent of Spain during the absence of her spouse for long periods.
2 CONT
