0 @N6000000002322281974@ NOTE There is little written about the wives during these times. The Medici
1 CONT family provided history with 4 popes and 2 Queens (consorts) of France. They
1 CONT had a common thread in their makeup of confronting their adversaries with
1 CONT bribes of gold rather than with battalions of armed men. They had a passion
1 CONT for the arts and letters, and for building. They were more than beneficient
1 CONT and ostentatious patrons of the arts; they were also enlightened, and were
1 CONT probably the most magnificient such patrons that the West has ever seem.
